{merge_note}

**Merge** — merge the existing New Entity History with the migrated Old Entity History.  
**Delete** — delete the existing New Entity History and migrate the Old Entity History. **This is destructive!**  
**Rename historical data** — preserve the New Entity History under a custom Archive Entity ID, then migrate the proven Old Entity History normally.  
**Ignore** — leave this conflict unchanged and stop asking about it.
